  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n +\n -\n ×\n /\n \n \n\n Stands For\n -\n +\n /\n ×\n \n \n\nGiven: 242 + 60 × 4 - 12 / 3 = ?\n\n242 + 60 × 4 - 12 / 3 = ? ⇒ 242 - 60 / 4 + 12 × 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 242 - __**62 / 4**__ + 12 × 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 242 - 15 + __**12 **____**×**____** 3**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**242 + 36**__ - 15 = ?\n\n⇒ __**278 - 15**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 263 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
